# Code Review Guide

A practical, priority-ordered code review checklist for software engineers.

Reviews are structured from highest business risk to lowest — so the most important issues are never buried under style feedback.

## Contents

- [English](code_review_guide_en.md)
- [Japanese / 日本語](code_review_guide_ja.md)

## Review Priority Order

1. Requirement & Business Correctness
2. Security
3. Performance & System Risk
4. Scalability & Concurrency
5. Architecture & Design
6. Testability
7. Test Coverage & Test Quality
8. Readability & Maintainability
9. Infrastructure & Cost Impact
10. Style & Formatting

Each section includes concrete bad/good code examples with explanations.

